          "title": "You'll want to know: la farola",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la farola — \"the street lamp, the lamp post\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Las farolas se encienden a las nueve. The street lamps come on at nine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A Spain word for a tall street lamp."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "farola is built on farol \"lantern\". The word is usually linked to faro \"lighthouse\", from Latin pharus, though the details are not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
